# WalletConnect Cloud project ID (required for the WalletConnect
# connector to actually work — get one free at https://cloud.reown.com).
# Without it, MetaMask/injected/Safe wallets still work fine; only the
# WalletConnect QR-code connector is degraded.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=

# Real on-chain payment for the card-issuance fee (src/lib/payments.ts,
# src/app/apply/page.tsx) — currently a small test-ETH transfer on
# Robinhood Chain Testnet, not USDG: there's no official USDG contract
# on testnet (docs.robinhood.com/chain/contracts only lists mainnet),
# and the testnet explorer's token search turns up ~50 unrelated
# contracts all named "USDG" — ordinary testnet token-squatting, not
# something to guess an address from. Switch to the ERC-20 path
# (erc20Abi in payments.ts) once a real testnet USDG or a self-deployed
# mock is confirmed.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TREASURY_ADDRESS: the wallet that receives the fee.
# Required, or the Apply screen shows "Payment not configured yet" and
# disables the pay button — it never falls back to a fake/mock charge.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TREASURY_ADDRESS=
